hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"567","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham ko ghoda khilaya, ham ko gadhe ke goshton se mana farmaya."
"568","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne paltu gadhe ke goshton ke khane se mana farmaya."
"569","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne subah sawere Khaibar par hamla farmaya; woh aurton ke sath qile se nikal chuke the. Jab unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha to kaha: Muhammad aur lashkar, Muhammad aur lashkar. Phir woh qile ki taraf palte. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne dono hath uthae aur teen takbeeren kahin: 'Allahu Akbar, Khaibar barbad; beshak jab ham kisi qaum ke maidan mein utarte hain to daraye gaon ki subah buri hoti hai.' Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use fath farmaya to unhen gadhe mile aur unhon ne un mein se pakaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munadi ne pukara: 'Beshak Allah aur Us ke Rasool tumhen us se mana farmate hain; woh napak hai, handiyan undel do.'"
"570","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Zaid (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Zaid se kaha: Woh gumaan karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne paltu gadhe ke goshton se mana farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas Hakam bin Amr Ghifari Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yeh kehte the; lekin ilm ke samandar Ibn Abbas ne is ka inkar farmaya. Unhon ne padha: ﴿قُل لَّا أَجِدُ فِي مَا أُوحِيَ إِلَيَّ مُحَرَّمًا عَلَىٰ طَاعِمٍ يَطْعَمُهُ﴾ [Al-An'am: 145] ayat."
"571","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ghoda zibah kiya aur use khaya."
"572","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aane wala aaya aur kaha: Gadhe khae ja rahe hain. Phir Aap ke paas aane wala aaya aur kaha: Gadhe khae ja rahe hain. Phir Aap ke paas aane wala aaya aur kaha: Gadhe khatm ho gae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne munadi ko hukm diya ke pukare: 'Beshak Allah Azz wa Jall aur Us ke Rasool tumhen paltu gadhe ke goshton se mana farmate hain; woh napak hain. To handiyan undel di gayin jabke woh gosht se josh mar rahi thin.'"
"573","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abi Hathmah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke un ki qaum ke badon ne unhen khabar di ke Abdullah bin Sahl aur Muhayyisah Khaibar gae us tangi ki wajah se jo unhen pahunchi thi; dono apni hajat ke liye juda hue. Phir Muhayyisah aae aur unhen khabar di gayi ke Abdullah bin Sahl qatl kar diye gae hain aur faqeerv [khushk kunwan] ya chashme mein phaink diye gae hain. To woh Yahud ke paas gae aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, tum ne use qatl kiya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, ham ne use qatl nahin kiya. Phir woh gae yahan tak ke apni qaum ke paas aae; unhon ne un se is ka zikr kiya. Phir woh, un ke bhai Huwayyisah, jo un se bade the, aur Abdur Rahman bin Sahl, maqtool ke bhai aae [Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas]. To Muhayyisah bolne lage, jo Khaibar mein the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muhayyisah se farmaya: 'Bade se shuru karo, bade se shuru karo', yani umr. To Huwayyisah bole, phir Muhayyisah bole. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ya to woh tumhare sathi ki diyat den, ya unhen jang ka ailaan samjhen.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen is mein likha; unhon ne likha: Beshak ham ne, Allah ki qasam, use qatl nahin kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Huwayyisah, Muhayyisah aur Abdur Rahman se farmaya: 'Kya tum qasam khaoge aur apne sathi ke khoon ke mustahiq hoge?' Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya Yahud [pachas qasmen] khayen?' Unhon ne kaha: Woh Musalman nahin hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni taraf se us ki diyat di; Aap ne un ki taraf sau oontniyan bhejin yahan tak ke un ke ghar mein dakhil ki gayin. Sahl kehte hain: Un mein se ek surkh oontni ne mujhe thokar mari."
"574","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke zamane mein paltu gadhe ke goshton se mana farmaya."
"575","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Khaibar wale saal basti ke bahar gadhe paae aur unhen zibah kiya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munadi ne pukara: 'Handiyon ko un ke samet undel do.' To ham ne unhen undel diya jabke handiyan josh mar rahi thin. Abu Ishaq kehte hain: Main ne is ka zikr Sa'id bin Jubair se kiya; unhon ne kaha: Woh gadhe gandagi khate the."
"576","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo chidiya ya us se upar ko na-haq qatl kare, Allah Azz wa Jall us se us ke qatl ke bare mein poochega.' Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, us ka haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh use zibah kare aur use khae, us ka sar na kate aur use phaink de.'"
"577","[AI-translation] Hazrat Shaddad bin Aus (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah Azz wa Jall ne har cheez par ehsan likha hai; jab tum qatl [qisas] karo to qatl achcha karo; jab tum zibah karo to zibah achcha karo. Tum mein se har ek apni chhuri tez kare aur apne zabihe ko aaram de.'"
"578","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wala ki bae aur us ke hibah se mana farmaya."
"579","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wala ki bae aur us ke hibah se mana farmaya."
"580","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah Ummul-Mumineen (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere paas Barirah aayi aur kaha: Main ne apne ghar walon se nau ooqiyah par mukatabat ki hai; har saal ek ooqiyah; meri madad karo. To Aishah ne us se kaha: Agar tumhare ghar wale chahen ke main unhen un ke liye ginti poori dun, main unhen un ke liye ginti poori dun aur tumhari wala mere liye ho, to karun. To Barirah apne ghar walon ke paas gayi aur un se yeh kaha; unhon ne us par inkar kiya. To woh apne ghar walon ke paas se aayi jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baithe the. Us ne kaha: Main ne unhen yeh pesh kiya; unhon ne mujh par inkar kiya siwae is ke ke wala un ke liye ho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh suna; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se poocha; Aishah ne Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use lo aur shart lagao; wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.' To Aishah ne kiya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon mein khade hue; Aap ne Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan ki phir farmaya: 'Amma ba'd; logon ka kya haal hai ke woh sharten lagate hain jo Kitabullah Azz wa Jall mein nahin. Jo shart Kitabullah mein nahin woh batil hai agarche sau sharten hon. Allah ka faisla zyada haq hai, Us ki shart zyada mazboot. Aur wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"581","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se Hazrat Aishah Ummul-Mumineen (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek bandi khareed kar aazad karne ka irada farmaya. To us ke ghar walon ne kaha: Ham tumhen use is par bechte hain ke us ki wala hamare liye ho. To unhon ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh tumhen nahin rokta; wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"582","[AI-translation] Amrah bint Abdir Rahman (Rahimahallah) se riwayat hai ke Barirah Aishah Ummul-Mumineen se madad mangne aayi. To Aishah ne us se kaha: Agar tumhare ghar wale chahen ke main unhen tumhari qeemat ek dafa dun aur tumhen aazad karun to karun. To Barirah ne is ka zikr apne ghar walon se kiya; unhon ne kaha: Nahin, siwae is ke ke tumhari wala hamare liye ho. Malik kehte hain: Yahya bin Sa'id kehte hain: Amrah ka gumaan hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh tumhen nahin rokta; use khareedo aur use aazad karo; wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"583","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Barirah ko khareed kar aazad karne ka irada farmaya. To us ke aaqaon ne mujh par shart lagai ke main use aazad karun jabke wala un ke liye ho. To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use khareedo aur use aazad karo; wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko khutba diya aur farmaya: 'Qaumon ka kya haal hai ke woh sharten lagate hain jo Kitabullah Azz wa Jall mein nahin. Jo Kitabullah mein nahin woh shart lagae, us ke liye kuch nahin agarche woh sau sharten lagae.'"
"584","[AI-translation] Amrah bint Abdir Rahman (Rahimahallah) se riwayat hai ke Barirah Aishah se madad mangne aayi; Aishah ne us se kaha: Agar tumhare ghar wale chahen ke main unhen tumhari qeemat ek dafa dun to karun. Ravi kehte hain: To Barirah ne is ka zikr apne ghar walon se kiya; unhon ne kaha: Nahin, siwae is ke ke wala hamare liye ho. Ravi kehte hain: To Amrah ka gumaan hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Use khareedo aur use aazad karo; wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"585","[AI-translation] Nabhan, Umm Salamah ke aazad karda ghulam (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke woh un ke sath the; unhon ne un se poocha: Tumhari kitabat mein se kitna baqi hai? To unhon ne kuch zikr kiya jo muqarrar tha; unhon ne unhen hukm diya ke use apne bhai ya bhanje ko den, un se parda farmaya, aur kaha: Alaikas-salam. Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum [aurton] mein se kisi ka mukatab ho jabke us ke paas ada karne [ki raqam] ho to woh us se parda kare.' Sufyan kehte hain: Main ne use Zuhri se suna; Ma'mar ne mujhe pukhta farmaya."
"586","[AI-translation] Shu'bah Kufi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Burdah bin Abi Musa ke sath ghar ki chhat par tha; unhon ne apne beton ko bulaya aur kaha: Ai mere beton, main ne apne walid se suna, woh kehte: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo gardan aazad kare, Allah us ke har uzw ke badle [aazad karne wale ka] uzw aag se aazad farmaye.'"
"587","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm ke walid [Abu Bakr] (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke us kitab mein jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Amr bin Hazm ke liye likhi: 'Diyaton mein: Jaan mein sau oont lene; naak mein jab mukammal kati jae sau oont; ma'mumah [dimagh tak zakhm] mein jaan ka teesra; jaifah [pet ke andar tak zakhm] mein aisi hi; aankh mein pachaas; hath mein pachaas; paon mein pachaas; un mein se har ungli mein dus oont; dant mein paanch; mooziha [haddi zahir karne wale zakhm] mein paanch.'"
"588","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Ungliyon mein dus dus [oont].'"
